{"id":"diga","lemma":"diga","pos":"intj","rank":397,"glosses":["way to say hello on the telephone"],"ipa":"/ˈdiɡa/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-diga.wav","examples":[{"text":"Por favor, diga algo.","en":"Please say something.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454973"},{"text":"Por favor, diga que sí.","en":"Please say yes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441211"},{"text":"Hagan lo que les diga.","en":"Do as he tells you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449070"},{"text":"¡No diga ni una palabra!","en":"Don't say anything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/139981"},{"text":"Haz lo que te diga.","en":"Do whatever he tells you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1481"}]}